From c8a1d59e016e5e7314e1baf3cef2950d156c79a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: A6 FM bring-up <a6lte-fm@localhost>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] FMRadio: wire RDS/AF and FM-only recording

Serialize BCM metadata polling with tuner operations; update station
database, UI and notifications using decoded UTF-8 PS/RadioText. Do not
probe AF while recording or override queued user station selections.
Enable recording through an explicit, verified FM-tuner AudioRecord,
feeding the existing AAC/file workflow without duplicating playback.
Reject microphone fallback, route changes and read failures; stop on
focus, Bluetooth, headset and service teardown. Add host capture tests.

HAL routing and encoded recordings require A6 hardware validation.
